<body>
    <h1>16.04.2025</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p><br></p>
<p>Issues collected from github</p>
<p>*&nbsp;Font handling</p>
<p>&nbsp; <a href=3D"https://github.com/ebu/ograf/issues/1" class=3D"extern=
al-link" rel=3D"nofollow">https://github.com/ebu/ograf/issues/1</a></p>
<p>* Not allowed to load local resource</p>
<p>&nbsp; <a href=3D"https://github.com/SuperFlyTV/ograf-devtool/issues/2" =
class=3D"external-link" rel=3D"nofollow">https://github.com/SuperFlyTV/ogra=
f-devtool/issues/2</a></p>
<p>* data with playaction and load action also</p>
<p>&nbsp; <a href=3D"https://github.com/SuperFlyTV/ograf-devtool/issues/3" =
class=3D"external-link" rel=3D"nofollow">https://github.com/SuperFlyTV/ogra=
f-devtool/issues/3</a></p>
<p>* Possible issue using Shadow DOM</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Action:</p>
<ul style=3D"list-style-type: square;">
 <li>Johan will work on potential solutions that will be presented to the o=
thers during the next call</li>
</ul>
<p>Note from Ben:&nbsp; how he implement the font handling in &nbsp;DevTool=
</p>
<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; const yleNextFont =3D new FontFace("YleNext",`url(${i=
mport.meta.resolve("./fonts/YleNext-Regular.woff2")}) format("woff2")`);<br=
>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; await yleNextFont.load();<br>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; document.fonts.add(yleNextFont);<br>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; container.style.fontFamily =3D "YleNext, Roboto, sans-=
serif";</p>
<p>const reithSansExtraBoldItalic =3D new FontFace(<br>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 'ReithSans',<br>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; `url(./fonts/Reith/BBCReithSans_W_ExBdIt.woff2) format=
('woff2'), url(./fonts/Reith/BBCReithSans_W_ExBdIt.woff) format('woff')`,<b=
r>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; { weight: '800', style: 'italic', display: 'swap' }<br=
>
  );</p>
<p>const reithSerifRegular =3D new FontFace(<br>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 'ReithSerif',<br>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; `url(./fonts/ReithSerif/BBCReithSerif_W_Rg.woff2) form=
at('woff2'), url(./fonts/ReithSerif/BBCReithSerif_W_Rg.woff) format('woff')=
`,<br>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; { weight: 'normal', style: 'normal', display: 'swap' }=
<br>
  );</p>
<p>export const loadFonts =3D () =3D&gt; {<br>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Promise.all([<br>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; reithSansExtraBold.load(),<br>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; reithSansBold.load(),<br>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; reithSansMedium.load(),<br>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; reithSansRegular.load(),<br>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; reithSerifRegular.load(),<br>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ])<br>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; .then((fonts) =3D&gt; {<br>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; fonts.=
forEach((font) =3D&gt; document.fonts.add(font));<br>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; }).finally(() =3D&gt; {<br>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <a hre=
f=3D"http://console.info" class=3D"external-link" rel=3D"nofollow">console.=
info</a>('All loaded fonts:', [...document.fonts]);<br>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; })<br>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; .catch((err) =3D&gt; console.e=
rror('font error ', err));<br>
  }</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>NOTE from Ben on&nbsp;locally loading things - It is something to be con=
sidered for things like outside broadcast trucks.&nbsp;</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Agreed in the meeting:</p>
<ul style=3D"list-style-type: square;">
 <li>to add frame rate, resoultion and color space in the manifest</li>
</ul>
<p><br></p>
<p>Actions:</p>
<ul style=3D"list-style-type: square;">
 <li>Niels to setup a call with Tuomo, Davy and Johan to start the work on =
the server API</li>
 <li>Niels to have a call with the speakers before the webinar</li>
</ul>
